                     <code code="50567-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - WHEN USING SECTION"/>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water. Stop use and ask a doctor if irritation or redness develops.</paragraph>
